  "sourceTitle": "Onion Relish",
  "sourceText": "Onion Relish\nBy: Yuna Wu\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:17pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 medium onion, peeled\n3/4 teaspoon salt\n4 teaspoons lemon juice\n1/4 teaspoon lemon juice\n1/4 teaspoon paprika\n1/8 teaspoon cayenne pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cut onion crosswise into paper-thin rings. 2 Toss the rings with all the other ingredients to mix. 3 Set aside for 30 minutes (or longer). before serving.\n\nAbout\n\n\nA staple relish served with almost every Indian meal.",
